{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16000","headline":"东征行 · 王建","name":"东征行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桐栢水西贼星落，枭雏夜飞林木恶。\n相国刻日波涛清，当朝自请东南征。\n舍人爲宾侍郎副，晓觉蓬莱欠佩声。\n玉阶舞蹈谢旌节，生死向前山可穴。\n同时赐马幷赐衣，御楼看带弓刀发。\n马前猛士三百人，金书左右红旗新。\n司庖常膳皆得对，好事将军封尔身。\n男儿生杀在手里，营门老将皆忧死。\n曈曈白日当南山，不立功名终不还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}